      "keyLeverage": "控制供状附件、认证副本和见证说明",
      "defaultPrepare": "保管供状并制作认证摘要",
      "defaultCommit": "只在保管链和签押完整时附送供状",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n2.qingliu_law.01",
          "text": "“供状有签名不等于经手清楚，先核谁在何时见过原纸。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.first_memorial",
            "obj.ma_confession"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n2.qingliu_law.02",
          "text": "“要附送便用封条、见证与收件三项把路写死。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.first_memorial",
            "obj.ma_confession"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n2.qingliu_law.03",
          "text": "“若有人只肯签灾情不肯签责任，便把两份意见并列，不替他遮掩。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.first_memorial",
            "obj.ma_confession"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "谭纶能控制的不是奏疏口气，而是供状是否以原件、认证摘要或独立路线进入后续。太早暴露和永远留在本地同样危险。",
